  "length": 0,
  "status": "complete",
  "declared": true,
  "wire_layout": "声明式：无单一线体。成员逐列取自 clan_create / clan_emblem_update / clan_text_offer_set / clan_text_notice_set / clan_leader_change / clan_level_update / clan_leave_r 的字段表；文本成员一律定宽，宽度取证在读侧槽预算（clan_name 31B、offer_subj 49B、offer_body 31B、notice_body 433B）",
